$i=6, j=4$ -> $6 \times 4 = 24$
$i=8, j=3$ -> $8 \times 3 = 24$
Are there others?
$24 = 1 \times 24$ (No)
$24 = 2 \times 12$ (No)
$24 = 3 \times 8$ (Yes)
