Then $f(P)$ corresponds to the integer formed by concatenating $S_1 S_2 \ldots S_N$.
This is equivalent to $\sum_{i=1}^N A_i \cdot 10^{L_{i+1} + \ldots + L_N}$, where $L_k$ is the number of digits in $A_k$, and $L_{N+1} = 0$.
